OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd shower is possible at
OL,6,Ffirst, mainly running in through the
OL,7,FCheshire gap, but most areas look set
OL,8,Fto have a dry day with sunny spells. A
OL,9,Fbrisk northwesterly wind will ease,
OL,10,Fand feeling pleasant enough in the
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA ridge of high pressure will
OL,14,Ftopple across from the west bringing a
OL,15,Fmostly dry night across the region
OL,16,Fwith clear spells. Turning chilly in
OL,17,Fsome rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
