OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThursday will start fine
OL,6,Fwith some pleasant spells of sunshine.
OL,7,FCloud slowly increasing from the west
OL,8,Fthough with rain arriving later in the
OL,9,Fday. Becoming breezy too.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBrighter
OL,12,Fweather returns on Friday, with
OL,13,Fsunshine and occasional light showers.
OL,14,FA spell of wind and rain is likely
OL,15,Flater on Saturday, ahead of brighter
OL,16,Fskies with showers on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
